# Commits and pull requests

Subject only. No body. No trailers. No co-author line.

```
feat(backend): add hello response
fix(contract): reject unknown hello fields
docs: define the two product constraints
```

Types: `feat`, `fix`, `docs`, `refactor`, `test`, `chore`.
Scopes: `backend`, `frontend`, `contract`, or omit the scope for a repo-wide change.

A pull request title is that subject. The pull request body is empty.
